N5008 [temp.inst]/11: a virtual member of a class template may be instantiated
eagerly and must work through dynamic dispatch.  Guards the permitted-eager
carve-out so the Option B pivot keeps reachable virtuals instantiated.  See
doc/architectural/cpp-extern-template-member-instantiation.md.
